{{!
    @template mod_lightboxgallery/gallery_comment

    A comment on a gallery. Its id lets recent activity link straight to it (#c123).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id - The comment's id.
    * userpicture - HTML for the author's picture.
    * fullname - The author's name.
    * profileurl - The author's profile in this course.
    * date - When the comment was made.
    * content - The comment, already formatted as HTML.
    * deleteurl - Where to delete the comment, for those who may; otherwise null.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 12,
        "userpicture": "<img src=\"https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png\" class=\"userpicture\" alt=\"\">",
        "fullname": "Sam Student",
        "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/view.php?id=3&course=2",
        "date": "Wednesday, 1 October 2026, 2:00 PM",
        "content": "<p>Great photos from the field trip!</p>",
        "deleteurl": "https://example.com/mod/lightboxgallery/comment.php?id=1&delete=12"
    }
}}
<div class="lightboxgallery-comment card mb-3" id="c{{id}}">
    <div class="card-body d-flex">
        <div class="me-3">{{{userpicture}}}</div>
        <div class="flex-grow-1">
            <div class="lightboxgallery-comment-author">
                <a href="{{profileurl}}">{{fullname}}</a>
                <span class="text-muted">- {{date}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lightboxgallery-comment-content">{{{content}}}</div>
            {{#deleteurl}}
                <a class="btn btn-link px-0" href="{{deleteurl}}">{{#str}}delete{{/str}}</a>
            {{/deleteurl}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
